      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom bisect import bisect_left, bisect_right\n\ndef process_cake_and_strawberries():\n    # Read dimensions of the cake and number of strawberries\n    W, H = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n    N = int(sys.stdin.readline())\n    \n    # Dictionary to keep track of strawberries in each column\n    strawberries_in_column = defaultdict(list)\n    \n    # Read the coordinates of the strawberries\n    for _ in range(N):\n        p, q = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n        strawberries_in_column[p].append(q)\n    \n    # Read the number of cuts parallel to y-axis and their positions\n    A = int(sys.stdin.readline())\n    a = list(map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split()))\n    \n    # Read the number of cuts parallel to x-axis and their positions\n    B = int(sys.stdin.readline())\n    b = list(map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split()))\n    \n    # Initialize min and max strawberries in any piece\n    min_strawberries = float('inf')\n    max_strawberries = 0\n    \n    # Traverse each column to calculate the number of strawberries in each piece\n    for p in strawberries_in_column:\n        # Get the list of strawberries in this column\n        qs = strawberries_in_column[p]\n        qs.sort()\n        \n        # Count strawberries in each piece formed by vertical cuts\n        column_strawberries = [0] * (A + 1)\n        \n        # Map each strawberry to the corresponding piece\n        for q in qs:\n            i = bisect_right(b, q)\n            column_strawberries[i] += 1\n        \n        # Calculate the total strawberries in each piece formed by horizontal cuts\n        for i in range(1, A + 1):\n            total_strawberries = 0\n            for j in range(i):\n                total_strawberries += column_strawberries[j]\n            \n            # Update min and max strawberries\n            min_strawberries = min(min_strawberries, total_strawberries)\n            max_strawberries = max(max_strawberries, total_strawberries)\n    \n    # Output the minimum and maximum number of strawberries\n    print(min_strawberries, max_strawberries)\n\n# Call the function to execute\nprocess_cake_and_strawberries()\n```",
