1) milliseconds to press the 'a' key.  A is appended to the string on the screen.\n\nSample Input 2\n\n1 1 100\naAaAaA\n\nSample Output 2\n\n6\n\nSample Input 3\n\n1 2 4\naaAaAaaAAAAaAaaAaAAaaaAAAAA\n\nSample Output 3\n\n40",
