racters.\n\nSample Input 2\n\naaaa\r\nbbbbaaaa\n\nSample Output 2\n\n5 6 7 8\n\nSample Input 3\n\natcoder\r\natcoder\n\nSample Output 3\n\n1 2 3 4 5 6 7\r\n\nTakahashi did not mistakenly type any characters.",
