      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef find最长公共后缀索引(wordsContainer, wordsQuery):\n    # 创建一个字典来存储每个后缀对应的出现最短的字符串索引和长度\n    suffix_dict = {}\n    \n    # 遍历wordsContainer，填充suffix_dict\n    for index, word in enumerate(wordsContainer):\n        # 从后向前遍历每个单词，生成所有可能的 suffix\n        for i in range(len(word)):\n            suffix = word[i:]\n            if suffix in suffix_dict:\n                # 如果当前后缀长度小于已有记录的长度，更新字典\n                if len(suffix) < suffix_dict[suffix][1]:\n                    suffix_dict[suffix] = (index, len(suffix))\n            else:\n                # 如果后缀不在字典中，则添加\n                suffix_dict[suffix] = (index, len(suffix))\n    \n    # 创建结果列表\n    ans = []\n    \n    # 遍历wordsQuery，寻找对应的最长公共后缀\n    for query in wordsQuery:\n        max_length = -1\n        min_index = -1\n        # 从后向前遍历查询字符串，寻找最长的公共后缀\n        for i in range(len(query)):\n            suffix = query[i:]\n            if suffix in suffix_dict:\n                # 如果找到更长的公共后缀，或者找到长度相同但索引更小的后缀\n                if len(suffix) > max_length or (len(suffix) == max_length and suffix_dict[suffix][0] < min_index):\n                    max_length = len(suffix)\n                    min_index = suffix_dict[suffix][0]\n        # 将找到的最小索引添加到结果列表中\n        ans.append(min_index)\n    \n    return ans\n```",
