      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\ninput = sys.stdin.read\n\ndef sort_people_by_success_rate():\n    data = input().split()\n    N = int(data[0])\n    people = []\n    \n    index = 1\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        A = int(data[index])\n        B = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        success_rate = A / (A + B)\n        people.append((success_rate, i))\n    \n    # Sort by success rate (descending) and by index (ascending) in case of ties\n    people.sort(key=lambda x: (-x[0], x[1]))\n    \n    # Print the sorted indices of people\n    for _, person_id in people:\n        print(person_id, end=' ')\n\n# Call the function\nsort_people_by_success_rate()\n```",
