    "prediction": "glm-4-air",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_cost_to_make_equal(s):\n    n = len(s)\n    prefix_costs = [0] * n\n    suffix_costs = [0] * n\n    \n    # Calculate prefix costs\n    prefix_costs[0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        prefix_costs[i] = prefix_costs[i - 1] + 1\n\n    # Calculate suffix costs\n    suffix_costs[-1] = 1\n    for i in range(n - 2, -1, -1):\n        suffix_costs[i] = suffix_costs[i + 1] + 1\n\n    total_cost = float('inf')\n    \n    # Determine if we should make all '0's or all '1's\n    all_zeros = True\n    all_ones = True\n    for char in s:\n        if char != '0':\n            all_zeros = False\n        if char != '1':\n            all_ones = False\n\n    if all_zeros:\n        # If all characters are already '0', no cost is needed\n        return 0\n    elif all_ones:\n        # If all characters are already '1', no cost is needed\n        return 0\n\n    # Calculate the minimum cost to make all characters the same\n    for i in range(n):\n        # Cost to make all characters up to i equal to '0' or '1'\n        if s[i] == '0':\n            cost_to_i = prefix_costs[i]\n        else:\n            cost_to_i = prefix_costs[i]\n\n        # Cost to make all characters from i+1 to end equal to '0' or '1'\n        if s[i] == '1':\n            cost_from_i = suffix_costs[i]\n        else:\n            cost_from_i = suffix_costs[i]\n\n        total_cost = min(total_cost, cost_to_i + cost_from_i)\n\n    return total_cost\n```",
