    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To find the percentage decline in recorded international slot and route authorities, we use the formula for percentage change: \\((\\text{New Value} - \\text{Old Value}) / \\text{Old Value} \\times 100\\). Substituting the given values, we have \\((708 - 736) / 736 \\times 100\\). Calculating this gives \\(-28 / 736 \\times 100 \\approx -3.80\\%\\). \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{{-3.80\\%}}\n\\]",
