    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion:  These store goods for moderate to long periods:\n\nOptions: \nA. Storage warehouses.\nB. Inventory management systems.\nC. Freight trains.\nD. Production factories.\nE. Haulage transport.\nF. Retail outlets.\nG. Wholesale markets.\nH. Shipping containers.\nI. Electronic data interchange.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
