    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: For years you work as a grocery checker at a supermarket and one day you are replaced by self-serve checkout stations. What type of unemployment is this?\n\nOptions: \nA. Seasonal\nB. Structural\nC. Classical\nD. Traditional\nE. Cyclical\nF. Deflationary\nG. Inflationary\nH. Frictional\nI. Voluntary\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
