    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Find the probability that a face card is drawn on the first draw and an ace on the second in two consecutive draws, without replacement, from a standard deck of cards.\n\nOptions: \nA. 4 / 220\nB. 2 / 221\nC. 6 / 221\nD. 4 / 222\nE. 1 / 221\nF. 1 / 110\nG. 3 / 221\nH. 3 / 220\nI. 5 / 221\nJ. 4 / 221\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
